<title>UK: London precious metals fall to weaker close.</title>
<headline>London precious metals fall to weaker close.</headline>
<text>
<p>GOLD - Closed at $361.90/$362.40 vs $366.60/$367.10 previously. Fairly steady until fresh selling pressured mid-afternoon. May be targeting $360.00. Slightly oversold but very bearish.</p>
<p>SILVER - Closed down six cents at $4.68/$4.70. Followed gold.</p>
<p>PLATINUM - Always under pressure and ended down $4.20 at $364.30/$365.30. Very little buying interest.</p>
<p>PALLADIUM - Fairly steady at $119.70/$120.70, down $0.55.</p>
</text>
